{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/17/itm_5217696b929d2edc/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22331","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-10-16T21:08:36Z","content_hash":"f2abaaeca17e59e67ce7a4b292d59eebd17f0f3fae5af6be728c824eef56c369","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22331"},{"label":"Official implementation","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/KnowGPO"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.22331v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T21:08:36Z","fingerprint":"f2abaaeca17e59e67ce7a4b292d59eebd17f0f3fae5af6be728c824eef56c369","id":"itm_5217696b929d2edc","item_id":"itm_5217696b929d2edc","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-15T17:52:33Z","reading_minutes":20,"score":94,"sort_at":"2026-10-15T17:52:33Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"KnowGPO 为深度搜索 Agent 设计知识分组策略优化：把每题答案拆成原子知识条件，用每步累计满足的条件集合表示状态，在相同知识状态内比较动作，并以新增条件数作为过程奖励，再与终局正确性优势混合。作者在同一 Qwen3-8B、数据与工具设置下，报告其在 Xbench-2505/2510、BrowseComp-ZH、GAIA 达到 48.0/36.0/38.8/40.2，较 GRPO 分别高 2.0/2.0/5.9/5.2 点；知识分组 ESR 为 97.8%，观察分组为 51.8%。局限是条件依赖参考答案与成功轨迹，DeepSeek-v3.2 核验器并非完美，且结论限于三个基准、GPT-4o 判分和作者工具环境。","tags":["post-training","reinforcement-learning","search-agent","process-reward","credit-assignment"],"title":"KnowGPO: Knowledge-Grouped Policy Optimization for Search Agents","title_hash":"4e36daf47a25339d2631f378883368eba35735f3a85392778cc78ac988f90b66","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22331"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/17/itm_b5c7c8ba813123b4/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22244","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-16T21:00:00Z","content_hash":"3a0417c2d5691e128f3b661d06f59b1f76914a973bdb90b1e0885821dbaf4a72","evidence":[{"label":"Official arXiv paper and HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22244"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.22244v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T21:00:00Z","fingerprint":"3a0417c2d5691e128f3b661d06f59b1f76914a973bdb90b1e0885821dbaf4a72","id":"itm_b5c7c8ba813123b4","item_id":"itm_b5c7c8ba813123b4","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-15T17:19:40Z","sort_at":"2026-10-15T17:19:40Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"论文以 LinguaGuardBench 检验逐步 Agent guard 是否会因用户请求的语言而改变安全判决：它从 1,220 个标注工具调用步骤中仅翻译用户指令、保持轨迹与标签字节一致，并用 6 种英文改写、空白 placebo 和重复运行控制措辞与噪声。19 个 guard 的 489k verdict 显示，<13B guard 的 placebo-adjusted 翻转从法语 +1.5 pp 升至阿姆哈拉语 +4.4 pp；12–30B 开放模型主要增加误拦（最高 +5.0 pp FPR），<10B 模型则出现漏检（最高 -7.4 pp TPR），专用 guard 最敏感。frontier guard 基本不变，但最强 Gemini guard 去掉 request 字段后仍与全量判决完全一致，说明其稳健性可能来自该 benchmark 中请求字段冗余。局限包括五语覆盖、翻译生成器重叠、低资源语言人工验证不足，以及专用 trajectory-level guard 与 step-level 标签的可比性限制。","tags":["ai-safety","agent-guard","multilingual","prompt-injection","benchmark"],"title":"Language Is a Security Surface for Agent Guards","title_hash":"91fa29a8b567f6c33b9fe2d9c86a17643c88249643fe49506e5638217ad53ed4","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22244"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/15/itm_b828a308c17e39f5/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22019","category_id":"llm-post-training","collected_at":"2026-10-16T14:42:20Z","content_hash":"5358da8b85a307ebe7687866c19ed46a481c205b0ca3467db87085742fdc86d2","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22019"},{"label":"Paper PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.22019"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.22019v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:42:20Z","fingerprint":"5358da8b85a307ebe7687866c19ed46a481c205b0ca3467db87085742fdc86d2","id":"itm_b828a308c17e39f5","item_id":"itm_b828a308c17e39f5","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-15T14:58:00Z","sort_at":"2026-10-15T14:58:00Z","source_id":"arxiv-2610-22019","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"论文提出位于预训练与 SFT/RL 之间的 256K agentic midtraining：以 Issue--PR、连通仓库、diff/日志和仅 10% 的多 scaffold 轨迹训练，并保留 20% 预训练 replay。在相同 full SFT 后，Nano 的 SWE-bench Verified/Multilingual/Pro 从 60.7/55.8/32.0 提升至 64.5/62.8/35.5，Super 的 DeepSWE 从 11.7 升至 15.7；去轨迹或预测工具响应会显著损失收益。证据局限于作者数据与 harness，RLVR 仅单 seed、20 步，未证明最终 RL 上限。","tags":["agentic-midtraining","post-training","coding-agent","SWE-bench","long-context"],"title":"Priming Base Models for Agentic Post-Training: An Open Midtraining Recipe","title_hash":"f0becd27db7aa4243d69395555491fdf2bf185262d5aee71c053da45f7d90c01","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22019"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_a51e3c14f3ab4588/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20780","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-10-16T08:48:42Z","content_hash":"69732f7f762c3dd50225fd6cde0ee2e9fe28cbdc72f673d4cf0390e8085950bd","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and version history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20780"},{"label":"Full paper HTML","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.20780"},{"label":"Official code repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/LabRAI/ARIA"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20780v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:48:42Z","fingerprint":"69732f7f762c3dd50225fd6cde0ee2e9fe28cbdc72f673d4cf0390e8085950bd","id":"itm_a51e3c14f3ab4588","item_id":"itm_a51e3c14f3ab4588","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T18:27:47Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T18:27:47Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"ARIA 将多 Agent 的失败修复从线上反复搜索转为离线的执行验证训练：它在4个框架、6个benchmark、8个宿主模型的24,000+条轨迹中构造3,953条失败—修复对，依次以结构化SFT、DPO和执行反馈GRPO训练运行时检查与续写替换。作者报告7B模型域内SR/HIR为20.9%/4.54%，未见系统为21.0%/5.59%；结论受限于固定框架、benchmark evaluator与重建continuation，不能外推为任意生产Agent的安全自动修复。","tags":["llm-agent","multi-agent","runtime-repair","post-training","arxiv"],"title":"ARIA: Runtime Inspection and Amendment for Multi-Agent Systems","title_hash":"233b6aa9799c0ef335fb6358e5b8f8fb6decf35ce1502555f88c8686024d3b85","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20780"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_e47342c1f32a4cef/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20576","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-10-16T04:39:00Z","content_hash":"9c15fb1a59c96407e83a61c54d15de0bbb8c3d3bfe80ce8496d9ef16d8fd10b1","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.20576v1"},{"label":"Author code repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/ArtinTD/cross-interface-policy-regularization"},{"label":"Third-party index cross-check","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.deeppaper.ai/papers/2610.20576v1"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20576v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:39:00Z","fingerprint":"9c15fb1a59c96407e83a61c54d15de0bbb8c3d3bfe80ce8496d9ef16d8fd10b1","id":"itm_e47342c1f32a4cef","item_id":"itm_e47342c1f32a4cef","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T17:56:00Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T17:56:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"CIPR 将同一工具调用任务置于规范化接口与改名、重排、含劣化副本的对应接口中，以等价动作分布的 rescoring/rollout KL 约束后训练策略；在 BFCL v4 的持出扰动上，论文报告常规后训练近 25 点下降可恢复 10.5 点，Qwen2.5-3B 与 Qwen3.5-4B 的三组扰动均值分别达到 56.1% 与 80.7%，且原始接口准确率不降。局限是主要为单轮函数调用、最大 9B、每设置单次训练，需已知动作映射并保留推理 adapter，且不直接改善参数填写。","tags":["llm-agent","post-training","tool-use","robustness","CIPR","GRPO"],"title":"One Task, Many Interfaces: Simple Cross-Interface Consistency Training Improves LLM Agent Robustness","title_hash":"5325e6ed3f40c938cd822f7de52744b75209c6fa86665da9026e66270d3a79bf","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20576"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_9a173d46c7216564/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-10-16T02:44:26Z","content_hash":"4bb735755bfa82607c7d508e0d5c4cddbdf4b8b6987a0f898a751702d4fc8057","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563"},{"label":"Full paper PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.20563"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20563v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:44:26Z","fingerprint":"4bb735755bfa82607c7d508e0d5c4cddbdf4b8b6987a0f898a751702d4fc8057","id":"itm_9a173d46c7216564","item_id":"itm_9a173d46c7216564","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T17:49:37Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T17:49:37Z","source_id":"arxiv-forgetting-2026","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"论文研究长程自动研究 Agent 为何会因会话与候选历史累积而平台化：作者周期性保留自动评测器验证的全局最优候选、清除四个 Agent 的会话和搜索状态，再从空上下文继续。在 AHC014、Frontier-CS、VLIW kernel 与 nanochat 四项任务、等模型等总预算和每配置三次重复下，遗忘团队平均比四并行高10%、比单 Agent 高22%，单项相对并行最高15%；同状态对照中团队遗忘提升9.2%且花费15.32美元，继续仅1.4%且花费24.67美元。局限是仅验证一个框架/模型、四个可自动评分任务，且无法证明遗忘适用于需要完整审计、长反馈或不可逆动作的研究。","tags":["llm-agent","autoresearch","multi-agent","context-management","search"],"title":"Scaling Discovery Requires Forgetting","title_hash":"2f5f543b364ab5b8b6b8abbec83256bf13f4c3d76114d7a2598a3657bd81c36a","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_eabdba3d0ecd0e18/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19422","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-16T08:42:55Z","content_hash":"9610feab9774f96d20100a035ef91443f695c1b3839b8ba0fc29165b534b5b4a","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission record","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19422"},{"label":"arXiv full HTML paper","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2610.19422v1"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.19422v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:42:55Z","fingerprint":"9610feab9774f96d20100a035ef91443f695c1b3839b8ba0fc29165b534b5b4a","id":"itm_eabdba3d0ecd0e18","item_id":"itm_eabdba3d0ecd0e18","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T02:13:29Z","reading_minutes":24,"sort_at":"2026-10-14T02:13:29Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"AgentSafeEvo 用攻击者—防御者共同演化的 GRPO 训练工具调用 Agent：攻击者生成含用户查询、工具定义和环境观察的完整对抗任务，防御者以安全与正当任务效用的双重奖励学习执行；再以同一任务内防御回报方差加权两侧更新。论文在四个安全基准上相对 Static-AT 把 Agent-SafetyBench ASR 31.01% 降至 17.84%、AgentHarm 30.00 降至 6.53，并把 AgentDojo UA 提至 66.52%；ALFWorld/ToolHop 分别升至 43.72%/48.04%。限制是红队合成管线未发布、奖励依赖单一 Qwen3.8-27B 裁判，且只在 Qwen3-8B 训练，不能证明生产权限系统安全。","tags":["agent-safety","adversarial-training","GRPO","prompt-injection","tool-use"],"title":"AgentSafeEvo: Adversarial Co-Evolution for LLM Agent Safety","title_hash":"0eda25e9e31941858673a69b124eca9580e3bb38772be34790f90f0341f7ce9b","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19422"}
